{
  "about": "R1 (FAA-70, findings 10, 14, 15; FAA-78 finding 44): hostile inputs the Python and Node kits must answer alike. Read by test/test_kit_hostile_core.py and test/kit-hostile-core.test.mjs, which map each fn to the same call in their twin. expect is accepted or refused. An argument {\"fakeKey\": prefix} is assembled by the runners as prefix + 'sk-' + 24 'q', so no credential-shaped string sits in this file.",
